  "item_short_desc": "<p>Get ready to hit the gym with Rothco&rsquo;s Woodland Camo \"Booty Camp\" Booty Shorts &amp; Tank Top Set, the ultimate combination of comfort and style. Made from a premium cotton/spandex blend, these shorts and tank top offer exceptional breathability and elasticity, ensuring a comfortable fit all day long. The \"Booty Camp\" text featured on the back of the shorts and along the waistband adds a fun and stylish touch to the classic camo pattern.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
