  "description": "<p>Get ready to hit the gym with Rothco&rsquo;s Woodland Camo \"Booty Camp\" Booty Shorts &amp; Tank Top Set, the ultimate combination of comfort and style. Made from a premium cotton/spandex blend, these shorts and tank top offer exceptional breathability and elasticity, ensuring a comfortable fit all day long. The \"Booty Camp\" text featured on the back of the shorts and along the waistband adds a fun and stylish touch to the classic camo pattern. Crafted with both functionality and fashion in mind, these booty shorts and tank top are perfect for wearing as underwear or loungewear. The elastic waistband provides additional stretch, allowing for freedom of movement without sacrificing comfort. Whether you're relaxing at home, hitting the gym, or running errands, this set is designed to keep you looking and feeling your best. The tank top offers a relaxed fit and pairs perfectly with the booty shorts, creating a coordinated and fashionable ensemble. Whether you're looking to add a playful twist to your everyday wardrobe or simply want to lounge in style, Rothco&rsquo;s Booty Camp Booty Shorts &amp; Tank Top Set is the perfect choice. Treat yourself to comfort and style with this must-have set.</p>",
